endobj
11 0 obj
<</Parent 17 0 R/Next 12 0 R/Prev 10 0 R/Title(Conclusion C6: Option B adds leverage-like, correlated balance-sheet risk that Option A removes, through the actions of other parties (lenders and employers) in a downturn, not merely through market variance itself)/Dest 483 0 R>>
endobj
