<</Parent 17 0 R/Next 15 0 R/Prev 13 0 R/Title(Conclusion C9: Any currently-unused tax-advantaged retirement or HSA space strictly dominates taxable brokerage investing for new dollars, independent of how the $60,000 itself is allocated between Option A and Option B)/Dest 486 0 R>>
